{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A base ","type":"text"},{"code":"INotification","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" implementation.","type":"text"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/puremvc-swift-multicore-framework.PureMVC\/documentation\/PureMVC\/INotification"],"title":"Conforms To"}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/puremvc-swift-multicore-framework.PureMVC\/documentation\/PureMVC\/Notification\/init(name:body:type:)"],"title":"Initializers"},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/puremvc-swift-multicore-framework.PureMVC\/documentation\/PureMVC\/Notification\/body","doc:\/\/puremvc-swift-multicore-framework.PureMVC\/documentation\/PureMVC\/Notification\/name","doc:\/\/puremvc-swift-multicore-framework.PureMVC\/documentation\/PureMVC\/Notification\/type"],"title":"Instance Properties"},{"anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/puremvc-swift-multicore-framework.PureMVC\/documentation\/PureMVC\/Notification\/description()"],"title":"Instance Methods"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Notification"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"PureMVC does not rely upon underlying event models such","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as the one provided with Flash, and ActionScript 3 does","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not have an inherent event model.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Observer Pattern as implemented within PureMVC exists"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to support event-driven communication between the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"application and the actors of the MVC triad."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Notifications are not meant to be a replacement for Events"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in Flex\/Flash\/Apollo. Generally, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IMediator"},{"type":"text","text":" implementors"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"place event listeners on their view components, which they"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"then handle in the usual way. This may lead to the broadcast of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Notification"},{"type":"text","text":"s to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"trigger "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ICommand"},{"type":"text","text":"s or to communicate with other "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IMediators"},{"type":"text","text":". "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IProxy"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ICommand"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instances communicate with each other and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IMediator"},{"type":"text","text":"s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by broadcasting "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"INotification"},{"type":"text","text":"s."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A key difference between Flash "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Event"},{"text":"s and PureMVC","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Notification"},{"text":"s is that ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Event"},{"text":"s follow the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"‘Chain of Responsibility’ pattern, ‘bubbling’ up the display hierarchy","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"until some parent component handles the ","type":"text"},{"code":"Event","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", while","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"PureMVC ","type":"text"},{"code":"Notification","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"s follow a ‘Publish\/Subscribe’","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pattern. PureMVC classes need not be related to each other in a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"parent\/child relationship in order to communicate with one another","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"using ","type":"text"},{"code":"Notification","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"s.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"@see org.puremvc.swift.multicore.patterns.observer.Observer Observer","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"*","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/puremvc\/notification"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"PureMVC"}],"roleHeading":"Class","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Notification","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Notification","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Notification","externalID":"s:7PureMVC12NotificationC","symbolKind":"class"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/puremvc-swift-multicore-framework.PureMVC\/documentation\/PureMVC"]]},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/puremvc-swift-multicore-framework.PureMVC\/documentation\/PureMVC\/Notification"},"references":{"doc://puremvc-swift-multicore-framework.PureMVC/documentation/PureMVC/Notification/description()":{"role":"symbol","title":"description()","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/puremvc\/notification\/description()","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Get the string representation of the "},{"code":"Notification","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" instance."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/puremvc-swift-multicore-framework.PureMVC\/documentation\/PureMVC\/Notification\/description()","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","tex